### Plan route (New York to Los Angeles)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/route/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start": "New York, NY",
  "finish": "Los Angeles, CA"
}

### Plan route (Dallas to Seattle)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/route/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start": "Dallas, TX",
  "finish": "Seattle, WA"
}